# ============================================================================
# Parascribe .gitignore
# This working directory also holds unrelated tooling; only Parascribe files
# are tracked. Secrets, runtime data, and benchmark audio are never committed.
# ============================================================================

# --- Secrets (never commit) ---
.env

# --- Runtime data and personal audio ---
whisperx/data/
your_audio.*

# --- Benchmark datasets: public corpora (AMI, Oyez), NOT redistributed here.
#     Only the metadata manifest is kept; obtain audio from the sources in the
#     README. ---
testing_audio/dataset/
testing_audio/**/*.wav
testing_audio/**/*.mp3
testing_audio/**/*.json
testing_audio/**/*.txt
testing_audio/*.xlsx
!testing_audio/manifest.csv
!testing_audio/oyez_candidates.csv

#     Upstream corpus checkouts. These are separate git clones, not submodules,
#     so committing them would record a bare gitlink that nobody can resolve.
#     Re-create with:
#       git clone https://github.com/walkerdb/supreme_court_transcripts.git
#       git clone https://github.com/guokan-shang/ami-and-icsi-corpora.git
testing_audio/supreme_court_transcripts/
testing_audio/ami-and-icsi-corpora/
testing_audio/ami_public_manual_1.6.2.zip

# --- Generated by whisperx_cluster.py (`up`/`gen` rewrites both in place).
#     Tracked on purpose as the reference 2-replica topology that the paper's
#     benchmarks were run against. Regenerating for a different GPU layout will
#     show them as modified; that is expected, commit or discard as needed. ---

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
testing_audio/.python-deps/

# --- LaTeX build intermediates (paper/main.pdf IS committed) ---
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.toc
paper/*.fls
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg

# --- Unrelated stack files in this directory (not part of Parascribe) ---
docker-compose-vllm*.yml
docker-compose-trt*.yml
test_vllm.py
download_models.sh
Pipfile
Pipfile.lock
nextsteps.md

# --- Editor / OS / tooling ---
.claude/
.DS_Store
*.swp
